{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Landed as Gerrit change 3097, commit c6c3eda81a3 (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1). Pty probe, 2026-10-24, no credential helper for the host, stdin held open: the old credential lookup blocked until a 12 second bound killed it (rc 142); with GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 the lookup failed immediately with 'terminal prompts disabled', which the script reports as its named missing-credential error. make verify locally: 17 failures, all in reconciler/ from the pandoc x86_64 binary on this arm64 host (38 'Bad CPU type' lines); Linux CI green. The script's JSON body, )]}' prefix stripping and 409 stale handling were already in place and tested before this change."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792826184097996001,"uuid":"a0315065-d77d-4f97-a9ec-3cddd92bcc8e"}